0, 2026</span></span></p><h1 class="post__title" data-v-e79ea0f6>Evri Group invest over £4m to expand fulfilment network in Barnsley</h1></header><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/acqQE5GXnQHGZGfw_FulfilmentCentreExteriordc55.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/acqQE5GXnQHGZGfw_FulfilmentCentreExterior.png?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C0%2C2345%2C1502&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/acqQE5GXnQHGZGfw_FulfilmentCentreExterior.png?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C0%2C2345%2C1502&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/acqQE5GXnQHGZGfw_FulfilmentCentreExterior.png?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C0%2C2345%2C1502&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="Image showing external view of Evri&#39;s new fulfilment hub in Barnsley" width="960" height="615" class="post__featured-image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-e79ea0f6><section class="post__content" data-v-e79ea0f6><div data-v-e79ea0f6><!--[--><section id="evri-group-invests-over-£4m-in-new-barnsley-fulfilment-centre" class="section-wrapper rich-text" index="0" data-v-92714c58 data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!--[--><ul><!--[--><!--[--><li><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Evri Group invests over £4m in new Barnsley fulfilment centre<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->New 265,000 sq ft site designed to support next day demand and growth of SMEs<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->More than 150 jobs to be created in the community, which follows Barnsley becoming UK’s first ‘Tech Town’<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--></li><!--]--><!--]--></ul><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Evri Group, the UK’s premier parcel delivery company, has today announced the launch of a brand new 265,000 sq ft fulfilment centre in Barnsley, following an investment of over £4m into the site.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->This new Barnsley opening marks the latest milestone in Evri’s rapidly expanding fulfilment operation, which has seen sustained double-digit year-on-year growth since its launch in 2021.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Located less than 100 metres from Evri’s existing Barnsley hub, the new facility will enable parcels to be injected directly into its largest operational site every hour, facilitating seamless integration into Evri’s national and international network to unlock faster delivery options for all retailers.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Evri received the keys to the site on 18th March, beginning an immediate fit-out of the space, which will launch in July 2026 and include cutting-edge sorting and packing automation, allowing parcels to move from order stage to pick, pack and entrance to the delivery network within an hour.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->A key feature of the new site is its 11.59pm order cut-off time for next-day delivery – a significant extension that allows thousands of small and medium-sized businesses to get their goods to their customers as fast as the nation’s biggest brands.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->The facility also provides same-day dispatch, seven days a week, as well as support for Amazon Prime distribution and global scaling capabilities for bedroom CEOs looking to grow internationally.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->The announcement follows the success of Evri’s first fulfilment centre in Basildon, as well as additional sites on the US East Coast, the Netherlands and Oman, cementing its position as a global fulfilment solution for retailers of all sizes.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Following the recent announcement that Barnsley has been recognised as the UK’s first ‘Tech Town’, reflecting the town’s growing reputation as a hub for innovation and inward investment, Evri’s new fulfilment site builds on this momentum in supporting local growth, with over 150 new job roles created as a direct result.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--><!--]--></div></section><figure id="the-launch-of-this-purpose-built-fulfilment-facility,-designed-to-meet-the-needs-of-the-shopper-of-today-and-tomorrow,-will-bring-exciting-opportunities-to-some-of-the-uk-most-loved-brands-as-well-as-our-country’s-deep-reservoir-of-small-and-medium-size-companies.-we’ve-paired-cutting-edge-fulfilment-technology-with-a-direct-connection-to-the-evri-group’s-well-established-and-fast-growing-domestic-and-international-networks,-meaning-whatever-the-business-need,-we-have-a-solution." class="quote" index="1" data-v-8c8b68f6><blockquote class="quote__content" data-v-8c8b68f6><p data-v-8c8b68f6>The launch of this purpose-built fulfilment facility, designed to meet the needs of the shopper of today and tomorrow, will bring exciting opportunities to some of the UK most loved brands as well as our country’s deep reservoir of small and medium size companies.
We’ve paired cutting edge fulfilment technology with a direct connection to the Evri Group’s well established and fast growing domestic and international networks, meaning whatever the business need, we have a solution.</p></blockquote><figcaption class="quote__source" data-v-8c8b68f6><p data-v-8c8b68f6>David Saenz, Chief Commercial Officer at Evri Group</p></figcaption></figure><figure id="the-evri-team-has-been-an-ideal-partner-as-we-grow,-and-we’re-very-excited-with-the-new-warehouse.-being-able-to-order-at-midnight,-have-the-package-in-the-evri-network-within-an-hour-and-be-delivered-next-day-will-be-amazing-for-our-customers." class="quote" index="2" data-v-8c8b68f6><blockquote class="quote__content" data-v-8c8b68f6><p data-v-8c8b68f6>The Evri team has been an ideal partner as we grow, and we’re very excited with the new warehouse.
Being able to order at midnight, have the package in the Evri network within an hour and be delivered next day will be amazing for our customers.</p></blockquote><figcaption class="quote__source" data-v-8c8b68f6><p data-v-8c8b68f6>Amy Wilshere of Furocity, Evri fulfilment client</p></figcaption></figure><section id="rich_text" class="section-wrapper rich-text" index="3" data-v-92714c58 data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->ENDS<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Notes to Editors<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Images<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><a href="https://photos.app.goo.gl/gk5mepa8FjH1ptLq7" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->https://photos.app.goo.gl/gk5mepa8FjH1ptLq7<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Media enquiries  <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->For any enquiries relating to Evri Group or its companies; Evri, DHL eCommerce UK, UK Mail and Coll-8, please contact: <!--]--><!--]--><a href="mailto:prteam@evri.com" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->prteam@evri.com<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->About Evri  <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Evri Group brings together Evri, DHL eCommerce UK, customs clearance and logistics specialist Coll-8 and business letters leader UK Mail, to create the UK’s premier parcel delivery company. The combined Evri Group will deliver more than 1 billion parcels and a further 1 billion business letters annually.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Evri, the core operating brand, currently delivers around 900 million parcels a year, and is on a mission to be the most convenient way to send, receive and return parcels, without costing the earth.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Working with everyone from Europe’s top retailers, marketplaces and pre-loved sites to gift-givers, the roots of Evri can be traced back to Yorkshire in 1974. The business has grown over the last five decades and now has a team of 12,000+ employees and 30,000 couriers, as well as a growing network of more than 13,000+ ParcelShops and Lockers and 500+ state-of-the-art hubs and depots.  Following its acquisition of Coll-8, an Irish independent customs clearance and logistics specialist, and merger with DHL eCommerce UK, Evri Group continues to enhance its international capability and enable world trade.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Evri has 4 million independent 5-star Trustpilot reviews, an average courier rating of 4.6/5, reflecting a strong commitment to customer experience.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->For more info: <!--]--><!--]--><a href="https://urldefense.com/v3/__http:/www.evri.com/news-and-corporate__;!!KZXpRQ!XXp1b6auPQhqEikzO24Td1WLLcOiKei-_sEGnaz1LXy6FIZdIH744ZKALMLghNBHhvufy1YVkeCCqssIjm9R-A$" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->www.evri.com/news-and-corporate<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--><!--]--></div></section><!--]--></div></section><footer class="post__footer" data-v-e79ea0f6></footer></article></div></section><!--]--></main></div></div><div id="teleports"></div><script>window.__NUXT__={};window.__NUXT__.config={public:{ENV_NAME:"prod",PUBLIC_PATH:"https://www.evri.com",WEB_BASE:"https://www.evri.com/",PRISMIC_REPO:"ev-mercury",DEVTOOLS:false,API_BASE:"https://api.hermesworld.co.uk/",AUTH0_USERS_ENDPOINT:"https://hermes-df-prod.eu.auth0.com/userinfo",AUTH0_CLIENT_ID:"dC8K22keYtRszHe7dnmlWSve2kP7mUBF",AUTH0_DOMAIN:"hermes-df-prod.eu.auth0.com",AUTH0_LOGIN_REDIRECT:"https://www.evri.com/",AUTH0_LOGOUT_REDIRECT:"https://www.evri.com/",ASSETLINKS_PATH:"assetlinks-prod.json",APPLE_MERCHANT_DOMAIN_PATH:"apple-developer-merchantid-domain-association-PROD.txt",APPLE_APP_SITE_ASSOCIATION_PATH:"apple-app-site-association-PROD",CHATBOT_URL:"https://chat-loader.smartagent.app/loader/main.js",FEATURE_SWITCH_URL:"https://www.evri.com/feature-switches/feature-switches.json",FINDER_URL:"https://location-finder.evri.com",BASKET_API_KEY:"4GuiGkQaE92687ICJtKNRd01hc4JBKUG",BULK_API_KEY:"WtuYb1yZMIGwLJzEm0yUzhLzPGuKS632",EVRI_API_KEY:"0DExZiK9in2ihGce7cDPrnpQ4s4nIpWG",HELP_API_KEY:"IfhFrxnv1JmbNW2tBA9hnRvG1o1vnsx2",SEND_API_KEY:"fHbmtsuSHrBH5gaC6m2QF9QG3YAycmgN",TRACK_NON_ROTATING_API_KEY:"MgMPMhWhXxSp7xIoYUVnWDklTl7EXAgG",GLOBAL_CSS_URI:"https://resources.hermescloud.co.uk/global/",ROUTER_BASE:"/",ACCOUNT_ENDPOINT:"https://api.hermesworld.co.uk/enterprise-user-account-api/v1/",BUSINESS_ACCOUNT_ENDPOINT:"https://api.hermesworld.co.uk/business-account-enquiry-api/v1/",CLIENTS_JSON:"https://www.evri.com/clients/clients.js",CUSTOMER_ORDER_ENDPOINT:"https://api.hermesworld.co.uk/customer-order-api/v1/",RETAILERS_ENDPOINT:"https://api.hermesworld.co.uk/enterprise-returns-api/v1/retailers",TRACKING_ENDPOINT:"https://tracking.platform-apis.evri.com/v1/",CUSTOMER_